{"schema_version":1,"status":"complete","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01202-s00","batch":1202,"shard":0,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":0,"shard_end_exclusive":20,"translated_count":20,"entries":[{"entry_index":0,"uid":"zhcn:2aaa2e173f8de976da497a9d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嗯，开始觉得紧张了。","source_fingerprint":"049a3b7ddd1cd97ad92f7d40df467a31d68f083562dac681f84df7e42122ebb1","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71009"],"target_text":"Ừm, mình bắt đầu thấy căng thẳng rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":1,"uid":"zhcn:8fc49bd229c8c7dc47695041","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我有穿好吗……？","source_fingerprint":"ae4388657d831f8d016f8ff9622807133403ef44aa7649f16ad827a4556573ae","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71010"],"target_text":"Mình mặc ổn chứ...?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":2,"uid":"zhcn:61d993b5210567e93dbf7ae3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"希望能适合我……","source_fingerprint":"48dc87ce3da9e4faa9ed4259d0ce85d9e1507ed722b8241fb2a7529551698aa1","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71014"],"target_text":"Mong là nó hợp với mình...","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":3,"uid":"zhcn:91ff59ec0ddba98f81ee265b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"穿着这套衣服，就会觉得胸口好热……！","source_fingerprint":"9d1e8e949642d7316f46eced61508c1c7b820689e2e8931206611fe140c052f8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71015"],"target_text":"Mặc bộ đồ này, mình cảm thấy trong lòng nóng lên...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":4,"uid":"zhcn:6ecbd3c7a9f100d367a232fb","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我会像圣诞树的星星一样……\r\n闪闪发光喔。","source_fingerprint":"8b2ecab6f722d2a72c054176d105341e2f251fb65921c128605ee67a908b480c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71016"],"target_text":"Mình sẽ tỏa sáng...\r\nnhư ngôi sao trên cây thông Noel.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":5,"uid":"zhcn:5339310b14c62dc7bc93d914","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"你很在意装饰的事吗？\r\n那就把粉丝送我的说明书给你吧。","source_fingerprint":"5c151d63464e5c861fbfdc1e25db94e38c6c73eb00aad5619626080da1d36a04","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71017"],"target_text":"Bạn để ý chuyện trang trí à?\r\nVậy mình đưa bạn cuốn hướng dẫn fan tặng nhé.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":6,"uid":"zhcn:375571de480ca798d7b55034","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"很厉害。","source_fingerprint":"8e26b0287de96cf1164592796aa236a0940c2bb95269faf9dc0e4dd8bb94a014","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71018"],"target_text":"Tuyệt thật.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":7,"uid":"zhcn:4b1208787be4288ce57ca3a7","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"献上我的胜利给故乡的大家……！","source_fingerprint":"53519fdafb883a96741e64cab038c970532c0c1a6fdb2d84be8486aab0c6c3b5","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71019"],"target_text":"Xin dành chiến thắng của mình cho mọi người ở quê nhà...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":8,"uid":"zhcn:9e279d177d647879e213f168","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"去迎接吧。用我的双脚，去迎接命运。","source_fingerprint":"d7a619cdb2f1fce97d4bc8955eeb73269584bb96239037e5ac314fd52f496a8a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71216"],"target_text":"Đi đón lấy thôi. Bằng chính đôi chân mình, đi đón lấy vận mệnh.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":9,"uid":"zhcn:0a6dcc184e18af32133c3f4f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"发饰也是，星星也是。一直与我，同在。","source_fingerprint":"5c612cd9b848c3dbf55c3e200b524bfcf1e2479cd520ade49d78a039baac82a3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","71217"],"target_text":"Cả phụ kiện tóc lẫn những vì sao. Luôn ở bên mình.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":10,"uid":"zhcn:a917603a57ea7fff964c81ef","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"辛苦了","source_fingerprint":"bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","80000"],"target_text":"Vất vả rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":11,"uid":"zhcn:0eb0e1587b137d496bd0cafa","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我不会放水喔。","source_fingerprint":"c5ed438ef7902aa0cf534249523c5fcfd8554be2aa3c7358dd0525b7e8951a3c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","81000"],"target_text":"Mình sẽ không nương tay đâu.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":12,"uid":"zhcn:59ee1b24cbc2f1b398630d98","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"身体在发抖……\r\n好期待下场比赛……！","source_fingerprint":"d7dba9f7840ad20c6fda45c775ddd1460380bce2b2b54369b2c397f5a962e784","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","81001"],"target_text":"Cơ thể đang run lên...\r\nMình mong chờ cuộc đua tiếp theo quá...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":13,"uid":"zhcn:7be704be6c2f9d4c04f7c51d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"早安，已经吃过早餐了吗？\r\n还没的话我们一起去吃吧。\r\n我刚好觉得还没吃饱。","source_fingerprint":"da901717b4e028e38cf02a0cb61e6b5668fdd618eae8beaaa99ad5e9fd0c7b62","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","90000"],"target_text":"Chào buổi sáng, bạn ăn sáng chưa?\r\nNếu chưa thì cùng đi ăn nhé.\r\nĐúng lúc mình vẫn chưa no.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":14,"uid":"zhcn:6302edba23121a8432f49916","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"为了能跑得更快……\r\n今天也麻烦你了，训练员。","source_fingerprint":"9145c7f2186a1b319a25873df336f5416e42e56a22977bf3fc3a0af5b31c3f26","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","90001"],"target_text":"Để có thể chạy nhanh hơn...\r\nHôm nay cũng nhờ bạn nhé, Trainer.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":15,"uid":"zhcn:4183717759f690506779a2cf","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"来开始下午的训练吧。\r\n我的气势跟肚子都是满满的哦。","source_fingerprint":"b9a249d69bc753687409caf2eb338131189fd0256c07628f2e9b5cd8dd6871ba","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","90002"],"target_text":"Bắt đầu buổi tập chiều thôi.\r\nKhí thế lẫn bụng mình đều đầy ắp rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":16,"uid":"zhcn:d5fc3e4b45138b350156c393","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我觉得午休时间不够用，\r\n这里的食堂餐品太多了……","source_fingerprint":"4c180e227dd2ee5c0e76e6279054562b911557619f6ddb54cc66357a1a725569","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","90003"],"target_text":"Mình thấy giờ nghỉ trưa không đủ,\r\ncăng tin ở đây có quá nhiều món...","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":17,"uid":"zhcn:1b5ee5592e20ce8bcdf5384b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呼啊……差不多该睡觉了。\r\n可不能影响到明天的训练啊。","source_fingerprint":"6ebabec08e8d74674e2d78bd5aa879a05e7d3e4bd1d79a40bb8b6254b3f5275c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","90004"],"target_text":"Hàa... cũng đến lúc đi ngủ rồi.\r\nKhông thể để ảnh hưởng buổi tập ngày mai.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":18,"uid":"zhcn:5605e3a85d9521b4d68ab79e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"这么晚，辛苦你了。\r\n训练员也是很努力的人呢。","source_fingerprint":"1b03dd1920ecd9b187654fb4093757a22f45b33e1a492cfc6fb6aaf27f0b0faf","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","90005"],"target_text":"Muộn thế này rồi, bạn vất vả quá.\r\nTrainer cũng là người rất chăm chỉ nhỉ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":19,"uid":"zhcn:792c57b677d72dd533142a02","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"春天暖洋洋的，很舒服。\r\n我有时候会因为午睡跟散步\r\n而忘记要回去上课呢……","source_fingerprint":"ed466a307b248a3f5295b82ee839ce0420903a60be4f2dcdb2f38d826a481291","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","90006"],"target_text":"Mùa xuân ấm áp, dễ chịu thật.\r\nCó lúc mình ngủ trưa rồi đi dạo\r\nđến mức quên mất phải quay lại lớp...","reviewed":true}]}
